OL,3,GNEWSAEljamel: Public evidence hearings
OL,4,Abegin into rogue surgeon
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe inquiry into disgraced brain
OL,7,Fsurgeon Sam Eljamel has reached a
OL,8,F"watershed moment" as its first public
OL,9,Fevidence sessions begin, its chairman
OL,10,Fhas said.
OL,12,FEljamel was a consultant neurosurgeon
OL,13,Fat Ninewells Hospital in Dundee from
OL,14,F1995 until his suspension in December
OL,15,F2013.
OL,17,FA public inquiry is taking place after
OL,18,Fpatients of Eljamel raised concerns
OL,19,Fthat he had harmed as many as 200
OL,20,Fpeople.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
